    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport torch\n\n\ndef info(rows):\n    t = torch.tensor(rows)\n    return [list(t.shape), str(t.dtype)]\n\nprint(info([[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]]))\nprint(info([1.5, 2.5]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport torch\n\n\ndef info(rows):\n    t = torch.tensor(rows)\n    return [list(t.shape), str(t.dtype)]\n\nprint(info([[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]]))\nprint(info([1.5, 2.5]))\n```"
    }
  ],
